  "description": "'Something is SNS, dating lightly, ex-lovers like friends' These days, dating is like this? Haha Really? lol. A spring day full of excitement.. I will be satisfied with the webtoon again this time. ^^ \n\nStories Featured:\n1) **Chajatda! Kiss Zone** (찾았다! 키스존 - Found! Kiss Zone) by Lee Dong-Geon\n2) **Sunkiss-husseom?** (선키스후썸? - Sunkiss Aftersome?) by Kang Hwanyoung\n3) **Seonghyang Chai Hh** (성향 차이 ㅎㅎ - Difference in Inclination) by Gong Cheol-Jin\n4) **Neon Naui Trend** (넌 나의 트렌드 - You are my Trend) by Sangha\n5) **Nae Chingurang Jamanchu** (내 친구랑 자만추 - Sleep with my Friend) by Mun-To\n6) **Sangnamja Kim Ha-Yul-Teuk** (상남자김하율특 - Real Man Kim Ha Yul Teuk) by Yeo Seulgi\n7) **Jamanchu? Jamanchu!** (자만추? 자만추! - Conceit? Let's go!) by Kim Hyuna\n8) **Bidaemyeonsueop!** (비대면수업! - Non-face-to-face Classes!) by Seyun\n9) **Joseonnamja X MZ-Yeoja** (조선남자 X MZ여자 - Joseon man X MZ Woman) by Ryoung\n10) **Gajja Couple Doenayo?** (가짜 커플도 되나요 - Could it be a fake couple?) by Olso\n11) **Ingeopat Villain** (잉어팟 빌런 - Carp Pot Villain) by Han Seong-Man\n12) **Eumchimjjinttawaui Date** (음침찐따와의 데이트 - A date with a Yumchimchintta) by Rujeuna and Dai\n13) **Naekkeoindeut Naekkeogateun Neo** (내꺼인듯 내꺼같은 너 - You are like Mine) by Sunga\n14) **Namdeul Da Haneun Yeonae** (남들 다 하는 연애 - Love that everyone else does) by Seo-Nye\n15) **Ya, Na Bokaksaeng Hwaseogijana** (야, 나 복학생 화석이잖아 - Hey, I'm a fossil of returning students) by NIMNI\n16) **Hwayoirui Agun** (화요일의 아군 - Tuesday's Ally) by Lusideu\n17) **Joayo** (좋아요 - Like) by Hyojung\n18) **Naman Bom** (나만 봄 - Only I See) by Jyabachip\n19) **Eojjijeojji Ujji Bom** (어찌저찌 우찌 봄 - Somehow it's Spring) by Ori\n20) **Biroso Pieonan** (비로소 피어난 - Blooming at Last) by Youngmo\n21) **Analogy Naming** (아날로지 네이밍 - Analogy Naming) by Sam\n22) **F-wa T-sai** (F와T사이 - Between F and T) by Olive-yu\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
